# {{if .DisplayName}}{{.DisplayName}}{{else}}{{.Slug}}{{end}}

{{if .Description}}{{.Description}}{{else}}An iterion bot.{{end}}

Created with the studio bot builder. Layout:

- `main.bot` — the workflow: one adaptive `campaign` agent carrying the
  mission (its system prompt is the `mission` prompt block).
- `manifest.yaml` — catalog metadata (name, icon, when_to_use, triggers).
- `skills/` — drop `SKILL.md` files here to ship knowledge with the bot;
  they are mirrored into the run workspace's `.claude/skills/`.

Run it:

```sh
iterion run {{.Slug}}/main.bot
```

Or from the studio: open the bot's page and hit Launch (or Test for a
throwaway run).
